    "title": "Are grocery stores closed on Easter? Is Walmart, Aldi, Food Lion open?",
    "text": "April 5, 2026, 2:55 a.m. ETEaster is April 5, marking an important holiday in the Christian faith.The holiday, which follows a 40-day period known as Lent, celebrates the resurrection of Jesus Christ. The date Easter is celebrated changes from year to year because it is one of several \"moveable feasts\" in the liturgical year, according to the History Channel.Some retail and restaurant chains will be closed on April 5 in observance of the holiday. That will also be the case for grocery stores.Here's what you need to know about which grocery stores will be open and closed on Easter in 2026.Is Walmart open on Easter?Yes, Walmart will be open during regular hours on Easter, the company confirmed to USA TODAY.Walmart near me in Delaware117 Wilton Blvd., near New Castle705 Middletown Warwick Road, Middletown939 N Dupont Blvd., Milford263 Walmart Drive, Camden36 Jerome Drive, Dover4 College Park Lane, Georgetown22899 Sussex Highway, Seaford18922 Rehoboth Mall Blvd., Rehoboth BeachIs ShopRite open on Easter?Yes, ShopRite stores will be open on Easter from 6 a.m. to 10 p.m., but some store hours may vary.ShopRite near me in Delaware1300 Rocky Run Parkway, Brandywine Hundred501 S. Walnut St., Wilmington1600 W. Newport Pike, Stanton19 Chestnut Hill Plaza, Ogletown1101 Governors Place, BearFour Seasons Plaza, 700 Plaza Drive, GlasgowIs ACME open on Easter?Yes, most ACME stores will be open on Easter, but the hours may vary.ACME near me in Delaware146 Fox Hunt Drive, Bear1 University Drive, Christiana128 Lantana Drive, Hockessin460 E. Main St., Middletown100 Grove Lane, Newark100 Suburban Drive, Newark1308 Centerville Road, Prices Corner1812 Marsh Road, Brandywine Hundred2098 Naamans Road, Brandywine Hundred4720 Limestone Road, Pike Creek1401 N. Dupont St., Wilmington1901 Concord Pike, Fairfax236 E. Glenwood Ave., Smyrna18578 Coastal Highway, Unit 13, Rehoboth BeachIs Wegmans open on Easter?Yes, Wegman's stores will be open during regular hours on Easter.Wegmans near me in Delaware371 Buckley Mill Road, GreenvilleIs Food Lion open on Easter?Yes, Food Lion stores will be open during their normal business hours on Easter.Food Lion near me in Delaware1607 Pulaski Highway, Bear9537 Bridgeville Center, Bridgeville3609 Philadelphia Pike, Claymont38650 Sussex Highway, Delmar1030 Forest Ave., Dover250 Gateway South Blvd., Dover2004 Midway Drive, Harrington30214 Sussex Highway, Laurel501 W. Main St., Middletown951 N. Dupont Blvd., Milford28544 Dupont Blvd., Millsboro110 Broadkill Road, Milton1200 Beaver Brook Place, New Castle401 New London Road, Newark907 S. Chapel St., Newark22954 Sussex Highway, Seaford32 N. Dupont Highway, Selbyville37468 Lion Drive, Selbyville215 Stadium St., Smyrna4401 Governor Printz Blvd., Fox PointIs Giant Food open on Easter?Giant Food will be open on Easter Sunday, but hours may vary.Giant Food near me on Easter300 Eden Square Shopping Center, Bear200 Dove Run Drive, Middletown25939 John J. Williams Highway, Millsboro38069 Town Center Drive Unit 9, Millville19312 Lighthouse Plaza Blvd., Rehoboth Beach4301 Concord Pike, TalleyvilleIs Trader Joe's open on Easter?Yes, Trader Joe's stores will be open during normal hours on Easter.Trader Joe's near me in Delaware2500 Fashion Center Blvd., Christiana5605 Concord Pike, Brandywine HundredIs Safeway open on Easter?A majority of Albertson's banner stores will be open on Easter, but hours may vary.Those stores include Safeway, Albertsons, Jewel-Osco, ACME, Vons and Tom Thumb.Safeway near me in Delaware190 John Hunn Brown Road, Dover2400 Peoples Plaza, Glasgow19283 Coastal Highway, Rehoboth BeachIs Harris Teeter open on Easter?Harris Teeter stores will be open on Easter, but hours may vary.Harris Teeter near me in Delaware26370 Bay Farm Road, Millsboro31221 Americana Parkway, SelbyvilleIs Lidl open on Easter?Yes, Lidl stores which typically are open from 8 a.m. to 9 p.m. will be open on April 5, but hours may vary.Lidl near me in Delaware1616 Pulaski Highway, Bear150 N. Dupont Highway, Dover359 Auto Park Drive, MiddletownIs Costco open on Easter?No, Costco warehouses will be closed on Easter.Is Sam's Club open on Easter?Sam's Club warehouses will also be closed on Easter Sunday.Is Whole Foods open on Easter?Most Whole Foods stores will operate from 8 a.m. to 6 p.m. on Easter.Customers can use the company's store locator tool to confirm their local store's hours.Is Aldi open on Easter?No, Aldi stores will be closed on April 5.",
